Package: plasma-nano
Version: @DEB_PLASMANANO_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: KDE
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://kde.org/plasma-mobile/
Depends: qt6-base, qt6-declarative, qt6-svg, qt6-wayland, kf6-i18n, kf6-itemmodels, kf6-service, kf6-windowsystem, kwayland, libplasma, plasma-workspace
Description: First-light Plasma Nano shell package for Xios
 Plasma Nano provides the lightweight shell package data and private QML plugin
 used by KDE's convergent/mobile shell path. This iOS build is trimmed to the
 nested Wayland path above the packaged KWin and Plasma Workspace base.
